{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":24.739999771118164,"text":"A hall almost fifty meters long, with a high wooden roof and a line of arches down the  The sick stayed here, each in a space of his own behind a curtain. The windows are small and set high on purpose. They pull warm air upwards and out, so it does not sit still. At the far end there is a chapel, because for the knights caring for the body and the soul was one job.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.7799999713897705},{"word":"hall","start":0.7799999713897705,"end":0.7799999713897705},{"word":"almost","start":0.7799999713897705,"end":1.3200000524520874},{"word":"fifty","start":1.3200000524520874,"end":1.7200000286102295},{"word":"meters","start":1.7200000286102295,"end":2},{"word":"long","start":2,"end":2.4200000762939453},{"word":"with","start":2.619999885559082,"end":2.759999990463257},{"word":"a","start":2.759999990463257,"end":2.9200000762939453},{"word":"high","start":2.9200000762939453,"end":3.299999952316284},{"word":"wooden","start":3.299999952316284,"end":3.5399999618530273},{"word":"roof","start":3.5399999618530273,"end":3.9000000953674316},{"word":"and","start":3.9000000953674316,"end":4.179999828338623},{"word":"a","start":4.179999828338623,"end":4.5},{"word":"line","start":4.5,"end":4.519999980926514},{"word":"of","start":4.519999980926514,"end":5.059999942779541},{"word":"arches","start":5.059999942779541,"end":5.059999942779541},{"word":"down","start":5.059999942779541,"end":5.340000152587891},{"word":"the","start":5.340000152587891,"end":5.71999979019165},{"word":"The","start":6.159999847412109,"end":6.5},{"word":"sick","start":6.5,"end":6.679999828338623},{"word":"stayed","start":6.679999828338623,"end":6.980000019073486},{"word":"here","start":6.980000019073486,"end":7.300000190734863},{"word":"each","start":7.739999771118164,"end":8},{"word":"in","start":8,"end":8.199999809265137},{"word":"a","start":8.199999809265137,"end":8.399999618530273},{"word":"space","start